/h3></div><p>From premium materials to expert craftsmanship, we build durable outdoor spaces designed to perform beautifully well.</p></div><div class=\"pool-card\"><div><div class=\"letter\">O</div><h3 class=\"title-values\">Originality &amp; Innovation</h3></div><p>We blend modern design, realistic 3D visualization, and smart technology to create functional outdoor environments.</p></div><div class=\"pool-card\"><div><div class=\"letter\">L</div><h3 class=\"title-values\">Loyalty &amp; Care</h3></div><p>We treat every client like family, delivering honest communication, transparency, and care from start to finish ok.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"aboutus-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div class=\"wrapper-kpi\"><div class=\"fullwrapper\"><div class=\"about-content\"><div class=\"block-left-text\"><h4>Project Management</h4><h2>Hands-On Project Management You Can Trust</h2><p class=\"grey\">At Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living, our project managers in North and South Florida oversee every step of your project — from design and permitting to installation and finishing touches.  By managing materials, scheduling, and crews internally, we ensure a smooth, organized, and worry-free experience from start to finish.</p></div></div><div class=\"block\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/pool-remodeling-outdoor-living-backyard-renovation-florida-1pool-remodeling-outdoor-living-backyard-renovation-florida.avif\" alt=\"Custom pool remodeling and backyard renovation project featuring high-end materials, outdoor living design, and expert craftsmanship for residential properties in Florida.\" class=\"image-about\"></div></div><div class=\"fullwrapper rotate\"><div class=\"block\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/pool-excavation-backyard-construction-luxury-home-florida-1pool-excavation-backyard-construction-luxury-home-florida.avif\" alt=\"Residential pool excavation and backyard construction project for a luxury home, showcasing expert craftsmanship and site preparation in Florida.\" class=\"image-about\"></div><div class=\"about-content switch\"><div class=\"block-right-text\"><h4>Project Monitoring</h4><h2>Complete Transparency &amp; Accountability</h2><p class=\"grey\">We believe in open communication and total accountability. You’ll have direct access to the owners throughout your project. Every build is personally inspected for quality control, ensuring it meets our highest standards before completion.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"fullwrapper\"><div class=\"about-content\"><div class=\"block-left-text\"><h4>Quality</h4><h2>Built for Excellence, Designed to Last</h2><p class=\"grey\">We take pride in doing things right the first time. Using high-end products, expert techniques, and proven methods, we deliver outdoor spaces that combine beauty, performance, and longevity. Whether you’re building a custom pool in Boca Raton, a pergola in Fort Lauderdale, or a complete backyard remodel in Gainesville — expect results that inspire.</p></div></div><div class=\"block\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/luxury-outdoor-living-pool-pergola-backyard-design-florida-1luxury-outdoor-living-pool-pergola-backyard-design-florida.avif\" alt=\"Luxury outdoor living space featuring a custom pool, modern pergola, and high-end landscaping designed for elegant backyard living in Florida.\" class=\"image-about\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"meet-us-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div class=\"wrapper-meetus\"><div class=\"divider\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/founders-mr-and-mrs-outdoor-living-company-florida.avif\" alt=\"Founders of Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living, a Florida-based company specializing in custom outdoor living, pergolas, and backyard transformations.\" class=\"image-animation\"></div><div data-w-id=\"cf0c09d3-d0b4-ba92-42a2-cec01a9dee35\" class=\"divider\"><div class=\"block-info-team\"><h2>Meet Rob &amp; Val – The Heart of Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living</h2><div class=\"text-divider white\"><p>Rob and Val are a licensed husband-and-wife team with decades of combined experience in construction and real estate. Former professional athletes, they bring the same discipline, teamwork, and focus to every project. Their approach is hands-on, honest, and family-oriented — built on trust, transparency, and superior service. Clients across Broward, Palm Beach, and North Florida appreciate their personal involvement and dedication to a stress-free, seamless experience.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"764f3c21-6644-7827-7b7a-25bbd0e40a23\" class=\"header-faq\"><h2>FAQs – Commercial Pool Construction</h2></div><div class=\"wrapper-faq-components\"><div data-hover=\"false\" data-delay=\"0\" data-w-id=\"41181522-7c59-1749-eb60-70505615b9d9\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Are your pools commercial-grade?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. We design and construct pools to meet all Florida commercial standards, including safety, accessibility, and energy efficiency.</p></nav></div><div data-hover=\"false\" data-delay=\"0\" data-w-id=\"41181522-7c59-1749-eb60-70505615b9e2\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do you manage all permitting?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. We design and construct pools to meet all Florida commercial standards, including safety, accessibility, and energy efficiency.</p></nav></div><div data-hover=\"false\" data-delay=\"0\" data-w-id=\"41181522-7c59-1749-eb60-70505615b9eb\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How long does construction take?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. We design and construct pools to meet all Florida commercial standards, including safety, accessibility, and energy efficiency.</p></nav></div><div data-hover=\"false\" data-delay=\"0\" data-w-id=\"41181522-7c59-1749-eb60-70505615b9f4\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can you integrate spas, bars, or water features?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. We design and construct pools to meet all Florida commercial standards, including safety, accessibility, and energy efficiency.</p></nav></div><div data-hover=\"false\" data-delay=\"0\" data-w-id=\"41181522-7c59-1749-eb60-70505615b9fd\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do you provide warranties?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. We design and construct pools to meet all Florida commercial standards, including safety, accessibility, and energy efficiency.</p></nav></div></div></div><img src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" class=\"design-bg\"></section><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>Regional Coverage With National Vision</p></div></div><div class=\"cms-country w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"cms-list-country w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-south-florida/custom-inground-pool-builders-remodeling-florida.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Aerial drone view of a luxury custom pool and outdoor living project in South Florida, showcasing modern pool design by expert custom pool builders.\" class=\"full-image-background\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7c8\" class=\"block-info-country\"><h3 class=\"white\">South Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in South Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered, permitted, and built for high-end residential properties.</p><a href=\"/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-south-florida\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">View South Florida Service Areas</a></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serv